  "public_notes": "Exact audit and repair of one projected total-coloring validator on the Petersen graph only.\n\nThe evidence file must be a JSON object with exactly four fields: `schema_version` must be `\"1\"`, `task_id` must equal the submission task ID, `result` must be an exact JSON copy of `submission.json`'s result object, and `limitations` must be an exact JSON copy of its limitations list.",
